&lt;p&gt;You’ll notice the biggest winners aren’t in generic web apps. They're in verticals like medical device firmware, aviation, and logistics. These fields demand custom logic, strict regulation, and code that can't break. The old way: brute force. The 2026 way: AI models trained on domain-specific datasets. Stop. Read this again. Most teams still use generic models. But the data shows vertical tuning is the only way to escape mediocrity.&lt;/p&gt;

