&lt;p&gt;Tuning AI tools on industry-specific data increases code accuracy by 28% (OpenAI, 2026). Generic copilots can write a React button. They can’t automate a radiology workflow safely. GE Healthcare ran a test: their AI-tuned PyCharm plugin reduced post-deployment bugs in imaging software from 19 per release to just 4.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Here’s the thing nobody tells you: vertical tuning costs money up front—$3,600/year for private model training (Hugging Face, 2026)—but pays back in code quality and compliance. The market has spoken. 44% of legal tech startups now budget for domain-tuned LLMs.&lt;/p&gt;

