&lt;p&gt;Another: AeroNav used TabNine to automate avionics code reviews. Before, three engineers spent 140 hours per certification. After deploying domain-tuned AI, that dropped to 37 hours. The cost: $6,000 in AI licensing. The ROI? $34,400 saved in billable hours. You do the math.&lt;/p&gt;

